                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Williams to Mr.
                            Adee.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-09-06"><hi rendition="#italic">September 6,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Aguirre just released and Sanguily’s case will be tried soon.</p>
